              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Percorso di  istruzione e formazione,  disciplinato nell'ambito di uno specifico quadro legislativo. Ciascun percorso è definito dalla combinazione tra un Percorso generale di istruzione e formazione e uno specifico Ordinamento.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/EstabilishedEducationTrainingProgramme</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>unstable</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language/>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/EstabilishedEducationTrainingProgramme</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>An education and training programme regulated within a specific legislative framework. Each programme is defined by the combination of a general education and training programme and a specific set of regulations.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
          </annotations>
        </iri>
        <iri>
          <value>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</value>
          <annotations>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Ordinamento</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Insieme delle disposizioni normative, organizzative e didattiche che disciplinano la struttura del sistema educativo, definendone i percorsi, i livelli, i titoli rilasciati, le modalità di accesso, i requisiti di frequenza e di valutazione, nonché i criteri per il conseguimento delle qualificazioni in un quadro di  coerenza,  validità giuridica e riconoscimento istituzionale.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>The set of legal, organisational, and educational provisions governing the structure of the education system, defining its programmes, levels, qualifications awarded, admission requirements, attendance and assessment requirements, as well as the criteria for the award of qualifications, within a framework that ensures coherence, legal validity, and institutional recognition.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Regulatory Framework</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/stat/onto/FormalEducationTraining/Ordinamento</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status</property>
              <object>
